        ],
        [
          66.0,
          1039.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "45. Having a clear view of what's in your control and what's not is vital to making a good decision regarding whether to give up or stick it out.",
      "block_bbox": [
